    </aside>
    <div class="faq-main">
      <div class="faq-search">
        <label for="faq-search-input" class="visually-hidden">Search the FAQ</label>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
        <input type="search" id="faq-search-input" placeholder="Search questions, for example Victoria Falls" autocomplete="off" data-faq-search>
      </div>
      <p class="faq-search-status" aria-live="polite" data-faq-status></p>
      <section class="faq-group" id="faq-getting-started" aria-labelledby="faq-getting-started-title" data-faq-group>
        <div class="faq-group-head">
          <h3 id="faq-getting-started-title">Getting started</h3>
          <span class="faq-group-count">5 questions</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">What does MICE stand for?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">MICE stands for Meetings, Incentives, Conferences and Exhibitions. It covers corporate events, business meetings, incentive travel, conferences and related group programmes.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">Which African destinations do you offer for MICE travel?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">We offer MICE programmes across Botswana, Kenya, Namibia, Rwanda, South Africa, Tanzania, Uganda, Zambia and Zimbabwe.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you create a tailor-made MICE programme?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. We design customised programmes based on your group size, objectives, budget, preferred destination, dates and interests.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you organise the entire MICE programme?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. We can assist with accommodation, conference venues, airport transfers, transportation, meals, activities, excursions, team-building and other event logistics.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">Can business events be combined with leisure or safari experiences?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Absolutely. Africa offers excellent opportunities to combine meetings and conferences with safaris, wildlife, cultural experiences, adventure and leisure extensions.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="faq-group" id="faq-destinations" aria-labelledby="faq-destinations-title" data-faq-group>
        <div class="faq-group-head">
          <h3 id="faq-destinations-title">Destinations</h3>
          <span class="faq-group-count">20 questions</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="na">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/na.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Why choose Namibia for a MICE event?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Namibia offers a unique combination of modern business facilities, spectacular landscapes, wildlife and memorable incentive experiences. It is particularly suitable for companies looking to combine business with an authentic African experience.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="na">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/na.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">What MICE destinations can we visit in Namibia?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Popular options include Windhoek, Swakopmund, Walvis Bay, Sossusvlei and the Etosha region, depending on the objectives and length of the programme.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="na">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/na.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you organise a conference and safari in Namibia?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. A corporate programme can combine a conference or meeting in Windhoek with safari and leisure experiences in other parts of Namibia.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="bw">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/bw.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Why is Botswana suitable for incentive travel?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Botswana is renowned for its exceptional wildlife, luxury safari lodges and wilderness experiences, making it an excellent destination for memorable incentive programmes.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="bw">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/bw.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you arrange a safari-based corporate incentive in Botswana?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. We can design programmes incorporating luxury accommodation, safari experiences, group activities and special dining experiences.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="ke">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/ke.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Why choose Kenya for MICE travel?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Kenya offers a strong combination of business facilities, international connectivity, wildlife and coastal experiences, making it suitable for both conferences and incentive travel.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="ke">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/ke.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Can a Kenya conference be combined with a safari?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. Groups can combine business events with safari experiences and other leisure activities, creating a balanced corporate programme.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="rw">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/rw.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Why is Rwanda a good MICE destination?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Rwanda offers a modern and organised environment for business events, particularly in Kigali, while also providing opportunities for cultural, nature and incentive experiences.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="rw">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/rw.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">What MICE experiences can we include in Rwanda?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Depending on the programme, groups can enjoy Kigali experiences, cultural activities, nature-based excursions and incentive experiences.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="za">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/za.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Why choose South Africa for a MICE event?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">South Africa offers a wide range of international conference venues, hotels, restaurants, attractions and business infrastructure, making it suitable for events of different sizes and requirements.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="za">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/za.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Which South African destinations are suitable for MICE?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Depending on the programme, popular options include Cape Town, Johannesburg, Durban and the surrounding safari regions.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="za">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/za.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you arrange a South African conference combined with a safari?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. Corporate groups can combine meetings or conferences with safari, sightseeing, wine, culinary and other leisure experiences.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="tz">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/tz.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Why choose Tanzania for incentive travel?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Tanzania provides outstanding opportunities to combine business travel with wildlife, safari and beach experiences, making it an attractive incentive destination.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="tz">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/tz.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you combine a conference with a safari in Tanzania?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. Programmes can be designed around meetings or conferences followed by safari experiences, with options to extend the trip to Zanzibar.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="ug">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/ug.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Why consider Uganda for MICE travel?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Uganda offers a combination of business facilities, nature, wildlife and unique experiences, providing opportunities for companies looking for something different.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="ug">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/ug.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">What incentive experiences are available in Uganda?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Depending on the itinerary, groups can enjoy wildlife experiences, nature activities, cultural encounters and adventure programmes.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="zm">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/zm.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Why choose Zambia for an incentive programme?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Zambia is well suited to incentive travel thanks to its wildlife, natural attractions, adventure activities and authentic safari experiences.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="zm">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/zm.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you combine a Zambia business event with Victoria Falls?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. Victoria Falls can be incorporated into a corporate or incentive programme, providing an unforgettable experience for delegates.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="zw">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/zw.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Why is Zimbabwe suitable for MICE and incentive travel?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Zimbabwe offers spectacular natural attractions, wildlife and cultural experiences, with Victoria Falls being a major attraction for incentive groups.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item" data-country="zw">
            <summary class="faq-question"><img class="faq-flag" src="/assets/images/flags/zw.svg" alt="" width="24" height="18"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you organise a corporate programme around Victoria Falls?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. We can create programmes combining corporate activities, accommodation, sightseeing, adventure and Victoria Falls experiences.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="faq-group" id="faq-planning" aria-labelledby="faq-planning-title" data-faq-group>
        <div class="faq-group-head">
          <h3 id="faq-planning-title">Planning and logistics</h3>
          <span class="faq-group-count">5 questions</span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">How far in advance should we book a MICE programme?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">We recommend booking as early as possible, particularly for larger groups, peak travel periods and major conferences, to secure suitable venues, accommodation and transportation.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you accommodate both small and large corporate groups?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. We can assist with programmes for small executive groups, medium-sized corporate groups and larger delegations, depending on the destination and requirements.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you arrange airport transfers and transportation?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. We can coordinate airport transfers, private vehicles, coaches, shuttles and transportation between destinations and activities.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">Can you arrange accommodation and conference venues?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Yes. We can source suitable hotels, lodges, resorts and conference venues according to your group size, location, event requirements and budget.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question"><span class="faq-q-text">How do we request a MICE proposal?</span><span class="faq-icon"></span></summary>
            <p class="faq-answer">Contact us with your destination, preferred dates, number of delegates, type of event, accommodation requirements and any activities you would like to include. We will use this information to develop a tailor-made proposal for your group.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="faq-empty" hidden data-faq-empty>
        <p>No questions match your search.</p>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-faq-reset>Show all questions</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

